},{"id":965,"depth":152,"text":966},"Captura micrófono o audio del PC, edita el clip y suéltalo en tu tablero.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":871,"description":1004},"recording-editor","6kXc1zcNP9ffTeowsG3fPS8NGId-wyGEWWxVXslWkZE",{"id":1012,"title":1013,"body":1014,"description":1229,"extension":161,"meta":1230,"navigation":163,"order":1231,"path":1232,"seo":1233,"stem":1234,"__hash__":1235},"content_es\u002Fremote-control.md","Control remoto",{"type":7,"value":1015,"toc":1222},[1016,1019,1022,1026,1055,1058,1061,1099,1103,1123,1126,1130,1162,1166,1172],[10,1017,1013],{"id":1018},"control-remoto",[14,1020,1021],{},"SoundNinja puede escuchar en tu red local para que Bitfocus Companion (o cualquier cliente HTTP\u002FWebSocket) reproduzca y detenga sonidos.",[18,1023,1025],{"id":1024},"activar-el-servidor-remoto","Activar el servidor remoto",[23,1027,1028,1033,1039,1045],{},[26,1029,28,1030,149],{},[30,1031,1032],{},"Ajustes → Remoto",[26,1034,1035,1036,149],{},"Activa el servidor remoto. El puerto por defecto es ",[30,1037,1038],{},"7331",[26,1040,1041,1042,149],{},"Opcional: define un token. Los clientes deben enviarlo como Bearer token o ",[116,1043,1044],{},"?token=",[26,1046,1047,1048,1051,1052,149],{},"Copia la URL ",[116,1049,1050],{},"http:\u002F\u002FIP:PORT",", o copia la IP del sistema desde ",[30,1053,1054],{},"Ajustes → Acerca de",[14,1056,1057],{},"Windows puede mostrar un aviso del firewall la primera vez que arranca el servidor. Permite el acceso a la red privada.",[18,1059,232],{"id":1060},"bitfocus-companion",[23,1062,1063,1070,1079,1086,1092],{},[26,1064,1065,1066,149],{},"Instala ",[88,1067,232],{"href":1068,"rel":1069},"https:\u002F\u002Fbitfocus.io\u002Fcompanion",[250],[26,1071,1072,1073,1078],{},"Descarga el módulo SoundNinja desde la carpeta oficial: ",[88,1074,1077],{"href":1075,"rel":1076},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Ftree\u002Fmain\u002Fcompanion-module-soundninja",[250],"companion-module-soundninja",". Aún no hay paquete en Companion Store — esta carpeta es la descarga.",[26,1080,1081,1082,1085],{},"En Companion abre ",[30,1083,1084],{},"Developer → Modules",", o suelta la carpeta en la ruta de módulos personalizados de Companion.",[26,1087,1088,1089,149],{},"En la carpeta del módulo ejecuta ",[116,1090,1091],{},"npm install",[26,1093,1094,1095,1098],{},"Añade una conexión ",[30,1096,1097],{},"Sound Ninja",". Pega la IP del PC, el puerto y el token si definiste uno.",[18,1100,1102],{"id":1101},"acciones","Acciones",[66,1104,1105,1111,1117],{},[26,1106,1107,1110],{},[30,1108,1109],{},"Trigger Sound"," — elige en el menú desplegable en vivo, o escribe un ID de sonido de 8 caracteres (las variables de Companion funcionan)",[26,1112,1113,1116],{},[30,1114,1115],{},"Stop Sound"," — detiene un sonido en reproducción por ID",[26,1118,1119,1122],{},[30,1120,1121],{},"Stop All"," — detiene todos los sonidos en reproducción",[14,1124,1125],{},"Copia un ID de sonido en SoundNinja desde el menú contextual del botón o el chip de ID de la selección múltiple.",[18,1127,1129],{"id":1128},"feedbacks-y-variables","Feedbacks y variables",[66,1131,1132,1138,1150,1156],{},[26,1133,1134,1137],{},[30,1135,1136],{},"Sound Playing"," — verdadero mientras ese ID de sonido está activo (úsalo para el color del botón)",[26,1139,1140,1143,1144,762,1147],{},[116,1141,1142],{},"$(soundninja:connected)"," — ",[116,1145,1146],{},"true",[116,1148,1149],{},"false",[26,1151,1152,1155],{},[116,1153,1154],{},"$(soundninja:playing_count)"," — cuántos sonidos suenan",[26,1157,1158,1161],{},[116,1159,1160],{},"$(soundninja:last_triggered)"," — último ID de sonido disparado",[18,1163,1165],{"id":1164},"api-http-avanzado","API HTTP (avanzado)",[14,1167,1168,1169],{},"Ruta base: ",[116,1170,1171],{},"\u002Fapi\u002Fv1",[66,1173,1174,1180,1186,1192,1202,1208,1216],{},[26,1175,1176,1179],{},[116,1177,1178],{},"GET \u002Finfo"," — nombre de la app, versión, protocolo, si se requiere un token",[26,1181,1182,1185],{},[116,1183,1184],{},"GET \u002Fsounds"," — lista de sonidos (id, name, tabs, active)",[26,1187,1188,1191],{},[116,1189,1190],{},"GET \u002Fstate"," — sonidos más IDs que suenan ahora",[26,1193,1194,1197,1198,1201],{},[116,1195,1196],{},"POST \u002Ftrigger"," con ",[116,1199,1200],{},"{ \"id\" }"," — reproducir un sonido",[26,1203,1204,1207],{},[116,1205,1206],{},"GET \u002Ftrigger\u002F:id"," — reproducir (fácil de probar en el navegador)",[26,1209,1210,1197,1213,1215],{},[116,1211,1212],{},"POST \u002Fstop",[116,1214,1200],{}," opcional — detener un sonido o todos",[26,1217,1218,1221],{},[116,1219,1220],{},"GET \u002Fws"," — estado en vivo; enviar comandos trigger\u002Fstop de entrada",{"title":151,"searchDepth":152,"depth":152,"links":1223},[1224,1225,1226,1227,1228],{"id":1024,"depth":152,"text":1025},{"id":1060,"depth":152,"text":232},{"id":1101,"depth":152,"text":1102},{"id":1128,"depth":152,"text":1129},{"id":1164,"depth":152,"text":1165},"Dispara SoundNinja desde Bitfocus Companion en la red local.",{},7,"\u002Fremote-control",{"title":1013,"description":1229},"remote-control","80wDgQjcOFBZ-zEcEomn6KPqnTOOWEstkAVGy6tohhY",{"id":1237,"title":1238,"body":1239,"description":1327,"extension":161,"meta":1328,"navigation":163,"order":1329,"path":1330,"seo":1331,"stem":1332,"__hash__":1333},"content_es\u002Fsupport.md","Soporte",{"type":7,"value":1240,"toc":1320},[1241,1244,1247,1251,1254,1261,1269,1273,1280,1282,1295,1299,1310,1314],[10,1242,1238],{"id":1243},"soporte",[14,1245,1246],{},"SoundNinja es un proyecto comunitario en beta temprana. La forma más rápida de pedir ayuda es GitHub.",[18,1248,1250],{"id":1249},"reportar-un-error-o-hacer-una-pregunta","Reportar un error o hacer una pregunta",[14,1252,1253],{},"Abre un issue en GitHub:",[14,1255,1256],{},[88,1257,1260],{"href":1258,"rel":1259},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fissues",[250],"github.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fissues",[14,